{"1":{"w":[{"c":"لِإِيلَافِ","d":"liīlāfi","e":"For (the) familiarity"},{"c":"قُرَيْشٍ","d":"qurayshin","e":"(of the) Quraish"}],"a":{"g":"For the accustomed security of the Quraysh -"}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"إِيلَافِهِمْ","d":"īlāfihim","e":"Their familiarity"},{"c":"رِحْلَةَ","d":"riḥ'lata","e":"(with the) journey"},{"c":"الشِّتَاءِ","d":"l-shitāi","e":"(of) winter"},{"c":"وَالصَّيْفِ","d":"wal-ṣayfi","e":"and summer"}],"a":{"g":"Their accustomed security [in] the caravan of winter and summer -"}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"فَلْيَعْبُدُوا","d":"falyaʿbudū","e":"So let them worship"},{"c":"رَبَّ","d":"rabba","e":"(the) Lord"},{"c":"هَذَا","d":"hādhā","e":"(of) this"},{"c":"الْبَيْتِ","d":"l-bayti","e":"House"}],"a":{"g":"Let them worship the Lord of this House,"}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"The One Who"},{"c":"أَطْعَمَهُمْ","d":"aṭʿamahum","e":"feeds them"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"against"},{"c":"جُوعٍ","d":"jūʿin","e":"hunger"},{"c":"وَءَامَنَهُمْ","d":"waāmanahum","e":"and gives them security"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"against"},{"c":"خَوْفٍ","d":"khawfin","e":"fear"}],"a":{"g":"Who has fed them, [saving them] from hunger and made them safe, [saving them] from fear."}}}